Jurisdiction: ICH, US
Deadline: before implementation (REQ-070); before the change (immediate-hazard exception) (REQ-071)
Party: IRB/IEC; investigator
Verify: [verify] E6(R3) A1-1.4.7 frames this as an IRB/IEC written procedure; the party initiating the change is not named</bpmn:documentation>
