    <bpmn:messageFlow id="L4_03_M9" name="Immediate-hazard information submitted where required" sourceRef="L4_03_A3" targetRef="L4_03_P_RA">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 A1-2.5.5 (p. printed 13 / PDF 21); E6R3 A1-3.13.3 (p. printed 37 / PDF 45)
Requirements: REQ-082
Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH
Party: investigator; sponsor; investigator/institution or sponsor
Verify: [verify] in the EU all submissions are made by the sponsor, not the investigator (EUCTR-QA Q&amp;A 1.5) (C-12)</bpmn:documentation>
