    <bpmn:inclusiveGateway id="L4_03_G2" name="Which jurisdiction-specific actions apply?" gatewayDirection="Diverging" default="L4_03_F9">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Justification: A trial can run under EU CTR and an IND at the same time, so the EU urgent safety measure hand-off (C-08) and the FDA protocol amendment (21 CFR 312.30(b)(2)(ii)) can both apply; they are not exclusive alternatives (FLW-07, DEC-02). Default flow 'Neither' when no jurisdiction-specific action applies.</bpmn:documentation>
