    <bpmn:callActivity id="L4_03_A4" name="Handle urgent safety measures">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: EUCTR Art. 54(1) (p. OJ L 158/40); EUCTR Art. 54(2) (p. OJ L 158/40); EUCTR Art. 54(3) (p. OJ L 158/40); EUCTR-QA S10.9 (p. printed 8-9 (chapter 10); printed 9 (chapter 10)); EUCTR-QA S10.1 (p. printed 1-4 (chapter 10)); EUCTR-QA S7.27 (p. printed 22 (chapter 7); printed 23 (chapter 7))
Requirements: REQ-217, REQ-218, REQ-219, REQ-220
Binding: binding-law
Jurisdiction: EU
Deadline: without undue delay but no later than seven days from the date the measures have been taken
Record: urgent safety measure notification in CTIS
Party: sponsor; the investigator</bpmn:documentation>
