    <bpmn:task id="L4_03_A11" name="Report immediate-hazard deviation to IRB/IEC">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: 21CFR312 21CFR312.30(b)(2)(ii) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination); 21CFR56 21CFR56.104(c) (p. n/a - web text without pagination); E6R3 A1-1.4.8(a) (p. printed 10-11 / PDF 18-19); E6R3 A1-2.5.5 (p. printed 13 / PDF 21)
